{"3415410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Louisiana - The BOUNDS VR", "steam_appid": 3415410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth within a cursed Louisiana mansion in this narrative VR adventure blending voodoo mythology, exploration and puzzle-solving, where combat encounters enhance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Baron Samedi, every discovery pulls you deeper; a haunting descent into horror, where nothing, and no one, can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.poster.avif?t=1775723995\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.webm?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.mp4?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth… or become part of the mansion’s dark legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter is missing. And the further you investigate, the less things make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did your brother in law, Georges do and why? And what will you do when you finally find him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.poster.avif?t=1775723995\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.webm?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.mp4?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Pillars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Haunted Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search a decaying Louisiana estate filled with secrets, hidden paths, and unsettling traces of voodoo rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Ritual Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas and uncover the past through environmental puzzles and cryptic clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive When It Matters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly threats. Combat is rare but meaningful and tied to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Guide You Didn’t Expect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baron Samedi follows you throughout your journey… He seems to know far more than he lets on. Is he really on your side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Shape the Outcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder the choices become. And not every path leads to the same conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Closing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense yet accessible experience built on atmospheric storytelling and slow-burning tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to follow development and uncover the full story at launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/18944f7ad3a244fa893f99c22ab40078.poster.avif?t=1775723995\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/18944f7ad3a244fa893f99c22ab40078.webm?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/18944f7ad3a244fa893f99c22ab40078.mp4?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth within a cursed Louisiana mansion in this narrative VR adventure blending voodoo mythology, exploration and puzzle-solving, where combat encounters enhance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the mysterious Baron Samedi, every discovery pulls you deeper; a haunting descent into horror, where nothing, and no one, can be trusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.poster.avif?t=1775723995\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.webm?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.mp4?t=1775723995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth… or become part of the mansion’s dark legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter is missing. And the further you investigate, the less things make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did your brother in law, Georges do and why? And what will you do when you finally find him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.poster.avif?t=1775723995\" width=540 height=304 ><sou